{
    "chapter_num": 9,
    "verses_count": 38,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Forgives and Heals a Paralytic"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So He got into a boat, crossed over, and came to His own city. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then behold, they brought to Him a paralytic lying on a bed. When Jesus saw their faith, He said to the paralytic, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Son, be of good cheer; your sins are forgiven you.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And at once some of the scribes said within themselves, “This Man blasphemes!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus, knowing their thoughts, said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Why do you think evil in your hearts?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For which is easier, to say, ‘Your sins are forgiven you,’ or to say, ‘Arise and walk’?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But that you may know that the Son of Man has power on earth to forgive sins”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "—then He said to the paralytic, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Arise, take up your bed, and go to your house.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he arose and departed to his house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when the multitudes saw "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they marveled"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU were afraid"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and glorified God, who had given such power to men."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Matthew the Tax Collector"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As Jesus passed on from there, He saw a man named Matthew sitting at the tax office. And He said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Follow Me.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " So he arose and followed Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it happened, as Jesus sat at the table in the house, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " behold, many tax collectors and sinners came and sat down with Him and His disciples. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the Pharisees saw "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they said to His disciples, “Why does your Teacher eat with tax collectors and sinners?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Jesus heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Those who are well have no need of a physician, but those who are sick."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But go and learn what this means:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘I desire mercy and not sacrifice.’ For I did not come to call the righteous,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "but sinners,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits to repentance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "to repentance.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Is Questioned About Fasting"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the disciples of John came to Him, saying, “Why do we and the Pharisees fast "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU brackets often as disputed."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "often, but Your disciples do not fast?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Can"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. sons of the bridechamber"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "friends of the bridegroom mourn as long as the bridegroom is with them? But the days will come when the bridegroom will be taken away from them, and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "then they will fast."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "No one puts a piece of unshrunk cloth on an old garment; for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. that which is put on"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the patch pulls away from the garment, and the tear is made worse."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Nor do they put new wine into old wineskins, or else the wineskins"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "burst"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "break, the wine is spilled, and the wineskins are ruined. But they put new wine into new wineskins, and both are preserved.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Girl Restored to Life and a Woman Healed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "While He spoke these things to them, behold, a ruler came and worshiped Him, saying, “My daughter has just died, but come and lay Your hand on her and she will live.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jesus arose and followed him, and so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "did"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " His disciples."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And suddenly, a woman who had a flow of blood for twelve years came from behind and touched the hem of His garment. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For she said to herself, “If only I may touch His garment, I shall be made well.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus turned around, and when He saw her He said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Be of good cheer, daughter;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "your faith has made you well.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And the woman was made well from that hour."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Jesus came into the ruler’s house, and saw the flute players and the noisy crowd wailing, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Make room, for the girl is not dead, but sleeping.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " And they ridiculed Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when the crowd was put outside, He went in and took her by the hand, and the girl arose. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the report of this went out into all that land."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Two Blind Men Healed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Jesus departed from there, two blind men followed Him, crying out and saying, “Son of David, have mercy on us!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when He had come into the house, the blind men came to Him. And Jesus said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Do you believe that I am able to do this?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They said to Him, “Yes, Lord.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He touched their eyes, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“According to your faith let it be to you.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And their eyes were opened. And Jesus sternly warned them, saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“See that no one knows it.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when they had departed, they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. made Him known"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "spread the news about Him in all that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. land"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "country."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A Mute Man Speaks"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As they went out, behold, they brought to Him a man, mute and demon-possessed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the demon was cast out, the mute spoke. And the multitudes marveled, saying, “It was never seen like this in Israel!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the Pharisees said, “He casts out demons by the ruler of the demons.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Compassion of Jesus"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jesus went about all the cities and villages, teaching in their synagogues, preaching the gospel of the kingdom, and healing every sickness and every disease "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits among the people"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "among the people. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when He saw the multitudes, He was moved with compassion for them, because they were "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M harassed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "weary and scattered, like sheep having no shepherd. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He said to His disciples, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“The harvest truly is plentiful, but the laborers are few."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Therefore pray the Lord of the harvest to send out laborers into His harvest.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}